  "schema:description": "This dataset collects data on the dimensions of the manuscripts and scripts of twelfth-century logical commentaries. It contains measures of the manuscripts, scripts and internal ratios of twelfth-century logical commentaries (file A); of a group of twelfth-century manuscripts containing logical authoritative works, two of which preserve glosses from the same period (file B). This dataset forms part of a broader analysis of the scripts of twelfth-century manuscripts transmitting logical commentaries.\n\nOther: This contribution is one among the outputs of a research project funded by the European Union (ERC “Polyphonic Philosophy”, Grant Agreement no. 101041596). Views and opinions expressed are, however, those of the author only and do not necessarily reflect those of the European Union or the European Research Council Executive Agency. Neither the European Union nor the granting authority can be held responsible for them.\n\nTechnical information: Excel, null\n\nTechnical information: Graphoskop, null",
